      },
      {
        "id": "sh/y907a90b",
        "kind": "textbox",
        "text": "Structured Lookup: For deterministic intents, structured JSON catalogs (like course details) are queried.\nSemantic Retrieval: For unstructured intents, institutional documents are chunked, embedded into dense vectors, and indexed. The system retrieves Top-K passages using cosine similarity.",
